Configuration 2: LAS (post-quantum) + Groth16 proof of ∃r : A r = t ∧ ‖r‖∞ ≤ 1
  signature : LAS (simplified Dilithium-III)  [n=6, ell=5, n+ell=11, d=256, kappa=49, gamma=137984, q=8380417]
  role-A pi : Groth16 over BN254 (pairing-based zk-SNARK)
              classical (NOT post-quantum) proof of ∃r : A r = t ∧ ‖r‖∞ ≤ 1; the ternary bound is enforced by r³ = r per coefficient and the modular reduction by a range-checked quotient per row; requires a trusted per-circuit setup
              setup: trusted, per circuit (soundness requires the setup secret to be destroyed) (1.225142318s)
  binding   : 33c1947f2ba13f98 (∃r : A r = t ∧ ‖r‖∞ ≤ 1  (module-lattice preimage))
  fully PQ  : no

  Rejection gate: 2.8510 attempts/PreSign over 2000 calls
                  expected 2.77483, tolerance +/- 0.2481 (5 sigma)

