Configuration 3: LAS (post-quantum) + LaZer proof of ∃r : A r = t ∧ ‖r‖∞ ≤ 1
  signature : LAS (simplified Dilithium-III)  [n=6, ell=5, n+ell=11, d=256, kappa=49, gamma=137984, q=8380417]
  role-A pi : LaZer (LNP22 linear relation with norms)
              post-quantum proof of ∃r : A r = t ∧ ‖r‖∞ ≤ 1, via binary decomposition r = r₊ − r₋; knowledge error ≤ 2⁻¹²⁷ under M-SIS, zero-knowledge under M-LWE; exchanged off-chain only (paper §4.1)
              setup: transparent (public-coin; no trusted party) (0ns)
  binding   : 33c1947f2ba13f98 (∃r : A r = t ∧ ‖r‖∞ ≤ 1  (module-lattice preimage))
  fully PQ  : yes

